<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>RDK Motion Support</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Support for RDK Motion - Home Workout. Get help, report bugs or send feedback.">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(118, 181, 229, 0.28), transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, #0c253b 0%, #123a59 45%, #091d30 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      min-height: 100vh;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(900px, 90%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      padding: 24px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .brand img {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      color: #cce4f7;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: white;
    }

    main {
      padding: 80px 0 100px;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 7vw, 4.7rem);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #bed6e6;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.055);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #bdd3e2;
    }

    .button-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .button-primary {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #12344e;
    }

    .button-secondary {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    }

    ul {
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: #bdd3e2;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 35px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      color: #9eb9cb;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .nav-links {
        gap: 12px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }

      .brand span {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="container">
    <nav>
      <a class="brand" href="./">
        <img src="logo.png" alt="RDK Motion logo">
        <span>RDK Motion</span>
      </a>

      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="./">Home</a>
        <a href="support.html">Support</a>
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="container">

    <section class="hero">
      <h1>RDK Motion Support</h1>
      <p>
        Need help, found a bug or have feedback?
        We're happy to hear from you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Contact Support</h2>

      <p>
        For support, bug reports or feedback, contact:
      </p>

      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button button-primary"
           href="mailto:voidstationidle@gmail.com">
          Email Support
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Reporting a Problem</h2>

      <p>
        If you experience an issue, including the following information can help us investigate it faster:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Your device model</li>
        <li>Your iOS version</li>
        <li>Your RDK Motion app version</li>
        <li>A short description of what happened</li>
        <li>Steps that reproduce the issue, if known</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Feedback & Suggestions</h2>

      <p>
        Have an exercise suggestion, feature request or idea for improving RDK Motion?
        Feedback is always welcome.
      </p>

      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button button-secondary"
           href="mailto:YOUR-EMAIL@example.com">
          Send Feedback
        </a>

        <a class="button button-secondary"
           href="privacy.html">
          Privacy Policy
        </a>

        <a class="button button-secondary"
           href="./">
          Back to RDK Motion
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="container footer-inner">

    <div>
      © 2026 RDK Motion
    </div>

    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="./">Home</a>
      <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
